                    <TextBlock Text="BS LAB TOOL PRO V2.5 • UNIVERSAL SECURITY &amp; FRP ENGINE • ALL RIGHTS RESERVED" FontSize="9.5" Foreground="#64748B" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
